# Canonical reviewed solution: directly authored binary, not assembler output.
11111010 # instruction | CLI | Keep the final halt stopped.
10111000 00000000 00000000 # instruction | MOV AX,0 | Initialize both halves of AX.
10110100 00001110 # instruction | MOV AH,0E | B4 selects AH, the upper eight bits of AX.
10110000 01000010 # instruction | MOV AL,42 | B0 selects AL, the lower eight bits; 42 is ASCII B.
11110100 # instruction | HLT | Stop with AX=0E42.
